document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422204003:0":{"text":"確かに「鉄アタマ」の警戒レベルを引き上げましたが、この侵入者に対する判定はあり得ない……","source_cn":"我的确加强了铁脑袋们的警戒系统，调高了警戒等级，它们对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC39C92F19367DF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422204004:1":{"text":"アップデートの内容は常に安全を第一にしているから、ドワーフを攻撃するはずないんです！","source_cn":"但我可没有让它们攻击矮人！升级都是在安全的前提下进行的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB12357D30F85DF57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422204005:0":{"text":"じゃあ、さっき俺の頭をかすめた砲弾は何なんだよ！？","source_cn":"那刚刚擦着我的头飞过的炮弹是什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD08A06273550D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422204006:1":{"text":"おっと、あれは「鉄アタマ」の戦闘システムを改善するために、自分が実装した火力装置です。なかなか強力でしたでしょ？","source_cn":"嚯，那是我给铁脑袋们加装的火力装置，作战系统大提升，怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A2F009A6095CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422204007:1":{"text":"確かにすごい威力だった。十人のドワーフをまとめて倒せそうな火力だね。","source_cn":"确实威力十足，火力足够把十个矮人干趴下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D8351425CECF8D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu